{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"中俄美元首峰會即將舉行\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APEC-LATEST-26119-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】國家主席習近平將主持中俄美元首會談。</p><p>根據央視發布的片段，習近平和俄羅斯總統普京以及美國總統特朗普將同桌而坐，大廳中央放了一張圓桌，有三張椅子，普京將坐習近平右側，特朗普就在左側，旁邊則有為三國代表團成員準備的桌。</p><p>至於中美和美俄元首早前亦舉行會談。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:34:25.248712+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:05:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:14.079683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:27:50.124285+00:00","content_hash":"4d8f0e408588da76feddfdd9f42342e01a75aa17b8e0b574300cef1a6699e326","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:34:25.248712+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}